    <S id="blust-text-t03-s003" source="text 3, sentence 3; source printed pp. 255 (PDF pp. 265); English printed pp. 255 (PDF pp. 265)">
        <FORM kindOf="original">Cicu sa tmatitish, numa yanan shishí mulalu, numa mulhckiz yamin, tuqatuqash, parhaway, azazak musúy Raushian titishan, maqa yamin Lus'an.</FORM>
