        <FORM kindOf="standard">Thithu sa tmatitish, numa yanan shishi mulalu, numa mulhthkiz yamin, tuqatuqash, parhaway, azazak musuy Raushian titishan, maqa yamin Lus'an.</FORM>
        <PHON kindOf="standard">θiθu sa tmatitiʃ numa janan ʃiʃi mulalu numa muɬθkið jamin tuqatuqaʃ parhaβaj aðaðak musuj rauʃian titiʃan maqa jamin lusʔan</PHON>
        <TRANSL xml:lang="eng">He performs a (ceremonial) cleansing, then a shaman calls up the ancestors and all of us, old, young, and children go to Raushian to be purified because it is our New Year.</TRANSL>
